requestHeaders.description:
A list of key-value headers you wish to add to every request we're making.
For example:
{ Authentication: 'SECRET_KEY', 'X-USER-ID': 'USER_ID' }

A list of key-value headers you wish to add to every request we're making.
For example:
{ Authentication: 'SECRET_KEY', 'X-USER-ID': 'USER_ID' }
